#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Right now I reply here without being @mentioned, for this conversation until /new. After /new: %{after}.\nUse /mention on or /mention off; add always to set it for this channel."
msgstr "Agora respondo aqui sem ser @mencionado, só nesta conversa, até o /new. Depois do /new: %{after}.\nUse /mention on ou /mention off; acrescente always para definir no canal."

